{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35693","headline":"酬刘书记见赠 · 李山甫","name":"酬刘书记见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独在西峯末，怜君和气多。\n劳生同朽索，急景似倾波。\n禅者行担锡，樵师语隔坡。\n旱□生赤藓，古木架青萝。\n石涧新蝉脱，茅檐旧燕窠。\n篇章蒙见许，松月好相过。\n思苦通真理，吟清合大和。\n□□□□□，风起送渔歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35693.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35693","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}